.TH QUIPU-READ 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-read \- Run a SPARQL query, optionally as of a valid time or transaction
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu read\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-fork\fR] [\fB\-\-entailment\fR] [\fB\-\-federation\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsparql\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a SPARQL query, optionally as of a valid time or transaction
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-fork\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-entailment\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-federation\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIsparql\fR>

